---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../../components/SectionHeader.astro";

const updatedAt = "2026-10-09";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — LagosLifeGuide.app"
  description="Terms of use for LagosLifeGuide.app: independent informational content, no affiliation with the game's developer, and content that may lag game updates."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-margin py-space-xl md:px-margin-tablet lg:px-margin-desktop">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Legal"
        title="Terms of Use"
        subtitle={`Last updated: ${updatedAt}.`}
      />

      <div class="mt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Informational content only</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Everything on LagosLifeGuide.app — guides, game data, and planner output — is provided
            for general game-information reference only. It is not professional, financial, or life
            advice, and we make no warranty that any value is current, complete, or error-free.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Independent site, no affiliation</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            LagosLifeGuide.app is an independent, fan-made third-party project. We are not the
            developer, publisher, or operator of Lagos Life, and we do not represent, speak for, or
            impersonate them in any way. We are not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by
            the game's rights holders.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Trademarks and intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            "Lagos Life", game names, artwork, and related marks and intellectual property belong
            to their respective owners. Any use of names on this site is for identification and
            reference only and does not imply ownership or endorsement.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Content may lag the game</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Lagos Life can change at any time. Our data is verified on the dates shown on each
            page, and may become outdated between checks. Always defer to the current state of the
            game itself. We label unverified or conflicting information as such; see the{" "}
            <a href="/sources/" class="font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-brand-dark">
              Sources & Verification
            </a>{" "}
            page for how we verify and update data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Planner output</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            The First Week Planner produces plans from the verification states of the underlying
            data at the time you run it. Planner results can become stale when the game updates,
            and the tool will ask you to re-run rather than rely on outdated conclusions. You are
            responsible for your own in-game decisions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Acceptable use and liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Do not misuse this site, attempt to disrupt it, or scrape it in a way that harms its
            availability. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or
            damage arising from use of, or reliance on, this site's content.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Changes and contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            We may update these terms as the site evolves; the date above reflects the latest
            revision. Questions can be sent to the site operator at{" "}
            <a href="mailto:lagoslifeguide.app@gmail.com" class="font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-brand-dark">
              lagoslifeguide.app@gmail.com
            </a>{" "}
            (provisional address).
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
